|公告发布时间={{#invoke:TimeNormalizer|format_time|{{{时间|}}}}}
|公告B站发布链接={{{b站|}}}
|公告官网发布链接={{{官网|}}}
}}<div class="klbq-notice-header">
<div class="klbq-notice-header__icon">[[文件:表情_60000031.png|48px|alt=公告]]</div>
<div class="klbq-notice-header__content">
<div class="klbq-notice-header__title"><span class="klbq-notice-header__tag">{{{类型|官方公告}}}</span><span class="klbq-notice-header__time">发布于 {{{时间}}}</span></div>
<div class="klbq-notice-header__links"><span class="klbq-notice-header__label">发布渠道：</span><!--
-->{{#if:{{{b站|}}}|{{a|href={{{b站|}}}|content=B站公告|class=klbq-notice-header__link klbq-notice-header__link--bilibili}}}}<!--
